# Contact form backend (this site has no backend of its own).
# Options:
#   - Formspree (https://formspree.io) or Web3Forms (https://web3forms.com) —
#     easiest to set up, each gives you a POST endpoint URL directly.
#   - A Google Apps Script Web App bound to a Google Sheet, if you want
#     submissions (name, email, phone, reason for contacting) tracked in a
#     Sheet. Deploy the script as a Web App ("Anyone" access) and paste its
#     /exec URL below.
# Copy this file to .env and fill it in.
PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=
